(I)--a name of the daughter of काल (time); enjoyed पूरु and blessed him with a boon; offered herself to बृहद्रथ and on his refusal cursed him to be ever wan- dering. She then approached Bhaya, the Yavana Lord who adopted her as his sister; helped the Yavanas in over- coming the city of पुरञ्जन;
